00:17:34.419 --> 00:17:37.622
Get this -- today, an original
copy of the U.S. Constitution

00:17:37.622 --> 00:17:41.693 line:0%
was expected to fetch
up to $20 million at auction.

00:17:41.693 --> 00:17:43.762
Wait, they're auctioning off
the Constitution?

00:17:43.762 --> 00:17:46.397
[ Laughter ]
Man, the U.S. really is
running out of money.

00:17:46.397 --> 00:17:48.133
[ Laughter ]
I didn't know you could do that.

00:17:48.133 --> 00:17:49.267
We're living
through crazy times,

00:17:49.267 --> 00:17:51.336
when a Bored Ape NFT
is worth more

00:17:51.336 --> 00:17:52.604
than the U.S. Constitution.

00:17:52.604 --> 00:17:53.905
[ Laughter ]

00:17:53.905 --> 00:17:55.574
And, finally,
I heard about a man in China

00:17:55.574 --> 00:17:57.643
who was banned
from an all-you-can-eat buffet

00:17:57.643 --> 00:17:59.077
for eating too much.

00:17:59.077 --> 00:18:00.478
[ Laughter ]

00:18:00.478 --> 00:18:02.314
In China, he's kicked out,
but in America,

00:18:02.314 --> 00:18:04.850
they'd hang his picture and give
him a show on the Food Network.

00:18:04.916 --> 00:18:09.287
Today the FDA approved Pfizer
and Moderna booster shots.

00:18:09.287 --> 00:18:11.289
Not only that,
a jury in Wisconsin

00:18:11.289 --> 00:18:12.624
approved gunshots.

00:18:12.624 --> 00:18:15.861
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:18:15.861 --> 00:18:18.296
Yeah, today, Kyle Rittenhouse
was found not guilty

00:18:18.296 --> 00:18:20.365
on all five counts
in the shooting

00:18:20.365 --> 00:18:21.733
that killed two men
and injured one

00:18:21.733 --> 00:18:23.935
during last year's
racial justice protests

00:18:23.935 --> 00:18:26.071
in Kenosha, Wisconsin.

00:18:26.071 --> 00:18:27.905
It just goes to show you can
do anything in this country,

00:18:27.905 --> 00:18:29.407
as long as you're in the white.

00:18:29.407 --> 00:18:31.376
[ Laughter and applause ]
On the --

00:18:31.376 --> 00:18:32.443
On the right.

00:18:32.443 --> 00:18:33.712
No, in the right.

00:18:33.712 --> 00:18:34.979
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:18:34.979 --> 00:18:36.481
Let's move on
to some lighter news.

00:18:36.481 --> 00:18:38.149
It was a big day
for President Biden.

00:18:38.149 --> 00:18:40.218 line:0%
This morning,
he went to Walter Reed

00:18:40.218 --> 00:18:42.420 line:0%
for a routine physical
and a colonoscopy.

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:44.589
[ Laughter ]

00:18:44.589 --> 00:18:46.825
I guess Biden's
infrastructure plan means all

00:18:46.825 --> 00:18:48.293
of the tunnels
are getting worked on tonight.

00:18:48.293 --> 00:18:52.063
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:18:52.063 --> 00:18:55.933
[ Cheering ]

00:18:55.933 --> 00:18:58.069
Yeah, but it wasn't
a typical colonoscopy.

00:18:58.069 --> 00:18:59.371
-Really?!
-No.

00:18:59.371 --> 00:19:01.572
Before the procedure,
Biden started talking

00:19:01.572 --> 00:19:04.476
and the anesthesiologist
fell asleep.
-Oh.

00:19:04.476 --> 00:19:07.846
[ Cheering and applause ]
[ Rimshot ]

00:19:08.180 --> 00:19:10.015
Well, after his procedure,
Biden took part

00:19:10.015 --> 00:19:12.683
in the annual presidential
turkey pardoning

00:19:12.683 --> 00:19:14.686
and last night
the two lucky turkeys stayed

00:19:14.686 --> 00:19:16.955
in their own suite
at the Willard Hotel.

00:19:16.955 --> 00:19:18.223
Here they are.
This is real.

00:19:18.223 --> 00:19:20.626
[ Laughter ]

00:19:20.626 --> 00:19:22.360
Yeah. Even weirder,

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:23.661
it was the fantasy suite.

00:19:23.661 --> 00:19:25.864
[ Laughter ]

00:19:25.864 --> 00:19:27.098
I heard that,
after their pardon,

00:19:27.098 --> 00:19:28.366
most presidential turkeys go

00:19:28.366 --> 00:19:29.634
to live the rest of their days

00:19:29.634 --> 00:19:32.170
on a farm in Virginia
called Gobblers Rest.

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:34.039
[ Laughter ]
And, believe it or not,

00:19:34.039 --> 00:19:35.407
all those pardoned turkeys
actually have

00:19:35.407 --> 00:19:38.210
their own reality show.
Watch this.

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:39.645
[ Suspenseful music plays ]
-Coming up on the next...

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:44.683
...Marshmallow throws down
the gantlet with Budge.

00:19:44.683 --> 00:19:45.917
-[ Gobbling ]

00:19:45.917 --> 00:19:48.519
-Carrot gets drunk
and belligerent at brunch.

00:19:48.519 --> 00:19:50.422
-[ Gobbling ]
[Bleep]

00:19:50.422 --> 00:19:53.959
-And Butterscotch throws
Caramel's prosthetic claw.

00:19:53.959 --> 00:19:55.727
-[ Gobbling ]

00:19:55.727 --> 00:19:57.829 line:0%
♪♪

00:19:57.829 --> 00:19:59.397 line:0%
-Hosted by Nick Cannon.

00:19:59.397 --> 00:20:00.465 line:0%
-Ah, interesting.

00:20:00.465 --> 00:20:01.533
What?!

00:20:01.533 --> 00:20:04.570
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:20:06.939 --> 00:20:08.639
Some more news
from Washington --

00:20:08.639 --> 00:20:09.908
today the House passed Biden's

00:20:09.908 --> 00:20:12.577
nearly $2 trillion
Build Back Better Act.

00:20:12.577 --> 00:20:15.813
And here's Speaker Nancy Pelosi
making the big announcement.

00:20:15.813 --> 00:20:23.888 line:0%
-On this vote, the yeas are 220,
the nays are 213.

00:20:23.888 --> 00:20:26.825 line:0%
The Build Back Better bill
is passed.

00:20:26.825 --> 00:20:27.926 line:0%
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:20:27.926 --> 00:20:31.796 line:0%
[ Hooting ]

00:20:31.796 --> 00:20:33.031 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:20:33.031 --> 00:20:34.699
-Yeah.

00:20:34.699 --> 00:20:36.634
Asked if that dancing
was awkward,

00:20:36.634 --> 00:20:38.102
the yeas were unanimous.

00:20:38.102 --> 00:20:40.271
[ Laughter ]

00:20:40.271 --> 00:20:42.206
♪♪

00:20:42.206 --> 00:20:43.608
Meanwhile,
Democrats actually planned

00:20:43.608 --> 00:20:45.043
to vote on the bill
last night,

00:20:45.043 --> 00:20:47.278
but House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy

00:20:47.278 --> 00:20:49.214
gave the longest
continuous speech

00:20:49.214 --> 00:20:52.084
in House history to stall it.
This is real.

00:20:52.084 --> 00:20:54.386
He talked for eight
straight hours.
[ Audience ohs ]

00:20:54.386 --> 00:20:56.420
Just listen to a little bit
of what he said. It's real.

00:20:56.420 --> 00:20:59.291 line:0%
-Picture America at a swim meet

00:20:59.291 --> 00:21:00.692 line:0%
after World War II.

00:21:00.692 --> 00:21:02.060 line:0%
I was in the sixth grade.

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:03.528 line:0%
I turn on the TV.

00:21:03.528 --> 00:21:05.096 line:0%
I watch Jimmy Carter

00:21:05.096 --> 00:21:06.297 line:0%
have a sweater on

00:21:06.297 --> 00:21:07.899 line:0%
and tell me
to turn the heater down.

00:21:07.899 --> 00:21:09.334 line:0%
You ever eaten one
of these baby carrots?

00:21:09.334 --> 00:21:10.535 line:0%
They're just big carrots
they chop

00:21:10.535 --> 00:21:11.803 line:0%
and they charge you more
when you buy them.

00:21:11.803 --> 00:21:13.571 line:0%
Personally, I didn't think
I could go this long.

00:21:13.571 --> 00:21:15.973
[ Laughter ]

00:21:15.973 --> 00:21:18.309
-He did that for eight hours.

00:21:18.309 --> 00:21:19.544
On the bright side,
when they heard

00:21:19.544 --> 00:21:21.145
that he could talk
for eight hours straight,

00:21:21.145 --> 00:21:22.647
Uber was like, "You're hired."

00:21:22.647 --> 00:21:24.683
[ Laughter ]

00:21:24.683 --> 00:21:26.184
Some business news --
I saw that Oprah

00:21:26.184 --> 00:21:30.288 line:0%
and Reese Witherspoon are
the newest investors in Spanx,

00:21:30.288 --> 00:21:31.623
although,
from now until New Year's,

00:21:31.623 --> 00:21:33.625
I think we're all
pretty invested in Spanx.

00:21:33.625 --> 00:21:34.825
[ Laughter ]

00:21:34.825 --> 00:21:36.694
And, finally,
McDonald's was just offering

00:21:36.694 --> 00:21:38.330
a big promotion on Egg McMuffins

00:21:38.330 --> 00:21:40.832
to celebrate the sandwich's
50th anniversary

00:21:40.832 --> 00:21:44.269
and it was so popular
that their app crashed.

00:21:44.269 --> 00:21:46.537
That's right, the McDonald's
app totally stopped working.

00:21:46.537 --> 00:21:47.973
As a result, it was renamed

00:21:47.973 --> 00:21:49.340
the McDonald's
ice cream machine.

00:21:49.340 --> 00:21:50.709 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

